# wasm-pack emits the binary here; commit the JS + .d.ts glue, ignore the built .wasm (mirrors the
# napi crate's `*.node` ignore — SMA-427).
#
# NOTE: `wasm-pack build` CLEANS its --out-dir each run (overwrites .gitignore with a bare `*`,
# DELETES package.json, even with --no-pack). The kernel-ts build/test tasks therefore build into a
# gitignored scratch dir (.wasmpack-out) and copy only the paigasus_wasm* glue back here, so the
# committed package.json/.gitignore/glue (what the `@paigasus/wasm` file: link resolves) are never
# clobbered. See ts/packages/paigasus-kernel/moon.yml.
*.wasm
.wasmpack-out/
